WEBVTT

00:13.507 --> 00:17.077
<b>I've heard that the saint 
possesses a special power,</b>

00:17.077 --> 00:19.307
<b>but it really doesn't seem that way to me.</b>

00:19.907 --> 00:20.837
<b>You'll understood soon.</b>

00:34.207 --> 00:36.217
<b>Your Holiness, hurry!</b>

00:38.127 --> 00:42.397
<b>The time for you to repent has now passed.</b>

00:42.397 --> 00:46.107
<b>For the crime of disrupting the 
peace of the Holy Kingdom of Qualia,</b>

00:46.107 --> 00:49.197
<b>and the sin of forsaking the Holy God Arlos,</b>

00:49.197 --> 00:50.937
<b>you are sentenced to a blooming burial.</b>

01:00.957 --> 01:03.387
<b>Some saint.</b>

01:03.387 --> 01:05.297
<b>More like an ultimate weapon.</b>

01:14.967 --> 01:17.127
<b>H-How on earth?!</b>

01:18.827 --> 01:21.157
<b>That power is part of why our nation</b>

01:21.157 --> 01:25.567
<b>is able to stave off evil and 
maintain a proper relationship</b>

01:25.567 --> 01:27.657
<b>with the nation of Elves.</b>

01:28.387 --> 01:29.847
<b>She buries her foes in flames</b>

01:29.847 --> 01:31.327
<b>and sends them off with flowers.</b>

01:32.017 --> 01:35.907
<b>That is one of the Idoragya Continent's 
Seven Great Savior Saints,</b>

01:36.347 --> 01:39.227
<b>Saint Soalina of Blooming Burials.</b>

01:41.327 --> 01:44.837
<b>I've sent the Paladins out 
to the nearby villages.</b>

01:45.397 --> 01:49.687
<b>Cardinal, what about the matter I 
discussed with you on the way here?</b>

01:49.687 --> 01:52.047
<b>Well, which matter would that be?</b>

01:52.357 --> 01:55.947
<b>The fact that there's an omen of the 
apocalypse in the Accursed Lands,</b>

01:55.947 --> 01:59.017
<b>and that we should dispatch 
Paladins to investigate it.</b>

02:00.357 --> 02:02.227
<b>I cannot comply with that.</b>

02:02.227 --> 02:04.977
<b>El-Nah
 Alliance of Elementals</b>

02:02.227 --> 02:05.067
<b>Holy Kingdom of Qualia</b>

02:02.987 --> 02:07.987
<b>Showing interest in the Accursed Lands in the 
Dark Continent far to the south is preposterous.</b>

02:08.437 --> 02:12.597
<b>Central would never give permission 
to use the Paladins for that.</b>

02:12.597 --> 02:15.197
<b>Then perhaps I'll go myself.</b>

02:15.197 --> 02:18.707
<b>Your Holiness, you don't understand 
the position you're in!</b>

02:18.707 --> 02:21.747
<b>You're no longer the simple 
village girl you used to be!</b>

02:25.237 --> 02:26.007
<b>Tsk.</b>

02:26.507 --> 02:29.717
<b>I'll send those I can personally command.</b>

02:34.867 --> 02:36.707
<b>Damn village wench.</b>

02:41.027 --> 02:43.937
<b>I have to save them.</b>

04:18.447 --> 04:19.987
The Time for Domestic Affairs Has Come!

04:20.327 --> 04:24.247
<b>Now, everyone! It's time for 
some fun, fun construction!</b>

04:24.247 --> 04:26.537
<b>Yeah!</b>

04:34.337 --> 04:36.637
<b>King Takuto, what's the matter?</b>

04:36.637 --> 04:38.007
<b>This is nice, isn't it?</b>

04:38.467 --> 04:43.347
<b>The Dark Elves worked quickly to 
establish this throne and council room.</b>

04:44.817 --> 04:46.557
<b>We're just getting started too.</b>

04:47.027 --> 04:48.737
<b>Let's make our civilization</b>

04:48.737 --> 04:52.167
<b>powerful enough to dominate
the land and pierce the heavens!</b>

04:53.817 --> 04:58.737
<b>All of your national administrators 
have assembled at your command.</b>

04:59.857 --> 05:02.087
<b>Then let's begin the council.</b>

05:02.087 --> 05:03.417
<b>Before that...</b>

05:04.257 --> 05:07.507
<b>O great and mighty king, 
please accept this offering.</b>

05:07.507 --> 05:09.287
<b>Huh? It's finished already?!</b>

05:11.747 --> 05:13.097
<b>Yes!</b>

05:13.097 --> 05:14.967
<b>I can finally get out of my pajamas!</b>

05:14.967 --> 05:20.467
<b>We all worked hard to make it so you 
could wear attire befitting a king.</b>

05:20.467 --> 05:22.887
<b>King Takuto, it looks really good on you!</b>

05:26.857 --> 05:29.347
<b>Our king is terribly delighted.</b>

05:29.347 --> 05:32.447
<b>We're honored to hear that he likes it.</b>

05:33.907 --> 05:34.587
<b>Yes!</b>

05:34.587 --> 05:38.557
<b>Now, the long-awaited time for 
domestic affairs has come!</b>

05:46.007 --> 05:51.837
<b>For starters, we shall conduct our meeting,
consulting with the king as necessary.</b>

05:52.197 --> 05:54.297
<b>Yeah, I'm counting on you.</b>

05:54.677 --> 05:59.617
<b>So, Lady Atou, what buildings should 
we start constructing first?</b>

05:59.617 --> 06:04.137
<b>We've already started preparations like
leveling the ground and pruning the branches.</b>

06:04.137 --> 06:06.977
<b>We'll create a Food Production facility.</b>

06:06.977 --> 06:09.477
<b>No one can wage war on an empty stomach.</b>

06:09.477 --> 06:12.227
<b>Not that we plan on waging any wars.</b>

06:12.227 --> 06:17.947
<b>Forgive me for asking, but can't our king 
create an infinite amount with his power?</b>

06:17.947 --> 06:21.147
<b>How long do you intend to make 
our king do such a thing?</b>

06:21.147 --> 06:25.327
<b>Plus, there's the issue of distribution 
that will arise as we expand our domain.</b>

06:25.707 --> 06:27.447
<b>You're entirely right.</b>

06:27.447 --> 06:30.577
<b>Please forgive my shortsightedness.</b>

06:30.577 --> 06:32.707
<b>So long as you understand.</b>

06:33.047 --> 06:34.157
<b>Here.</b>

06:34.157 --> 06:36.377
<b>Nice to meet you!</b>

06:37.757 --> 06:40.217
<b>Lady Atou, what's this?</b>

06:41.247 --> 06:43.097
<b>A Flesh Tree!</b>

06:43.817 --> 06:44.557
<b>Huh?</b>

06:44.557 --> 06:47.267
<b>It's a Flesh Tree!</b>

06:49.207 --> 06:52.727
<b>Um, could you explain in a bit more detail?</b>

06:52.727 --> 06:57.097
<b>This is one of our civilization's 
Food Production facilities.</b>

06:57.097 --> 07:00.657
<b>It's a tree that grows mystery meat 
that tastes like human flesh.</b>

07:00.657 --> 07:02.347
<b>It produces a large harvest,</b>

07:02.347 --> 07:03.557
<b>and it's technically meat,</b>

07:03.557 --> 07:05.777
<b>so it's very nutritious.</b>

07:06.087 --> 07:08.157
<b>It feels evil.</b>

07:08.537 --> 07:10.167
<b>We understand.</b>

07:10.167 --> 07:14.167
<b>However, there are those who may harbor 
ill feelings toward consuming human flesh.</b>

07:14.497 --> 07:16.997
<b>We'll only be planting them to get started.</b>

07:17.407 --> 07:19.467
<b>Everyone has likes and dislikes after all.</b>

07:19.547 --> 07:23.677
You have selected a building for construction.

07:19.547 --> 07:23.677
Constructing Flesh Tree

07:24.087 --> 07:26.087
<b>We'll also need a hut for managing it,</b>

07:26.087 --> 07:29.267
<b>and a Building for stockpiling food.</b>

07:29.267 --> 07:31.977
<b>I'll take charge of that.</b>

07:31.977 --> 07:35.187
<b>Please be nice to me.</b>

07:40.367 --> 07:43.067
<b>Next on the agenda is our Research.</b>

07:43.527 --> 07:46.067
<b>Since we're still a minor nation,</b>

07:46.067 --> 07:48.947
<b>we urgently need to acquire 
the latest technology.</b>

07:49.447 --> 07:51.177
<b>So, Lady Atou,</b>

07:51.177 --> 07:53.707
<b>what technology should we prioritize first?</b>

07:54.087 --> 07:57.457
<b>Magic Technology, obviously!</b>

07:57.457 --> 07:59.207
<b>Exciting!</b>

08:00.427 --> 08:03.067
<b>You look excited, my king.</b>

08:03.067 --> 08:08.197
<b>I'm a bit of a scholar of magic 
myself, so I'm excited too.</b>

08:08.197 --> 08:11.677
<b>So what kind of magic will we be researching?</b>

08:12.067 --> 08:13.887
<b>Military Magic!</b>

08:14.307 --> 08:19.927
<b>Normal magic can only be used to attack 
a few dozen people at most, right?</b>

08:19.927 --> 08:24.667
<b>If I may humbly say so, 
I can do that with ease.</b>

08:24.667 --> 08:28.807
<b>Of course, Military Magic allows you to 
attack armies on the scale of thousands,</b>

08:28.807 --> 08:32.107
<b>as well as altering the 
terrain to your advantage,</b>

08:32.107 --> 08:34.117
<b>along with other strategic uses.</b>

08:34.727 --> 08:38.337
<b>There's magic capable of 
producing such miracles?!</b>

08:38.637 --> 08:45.467
<b>For this, we'll need to select a few who are 
talented with magic to conduct the Research.</b>

08:45.787 --> 08:47.967
<b>It's not a very difficult Technology,</b>

08:47.967 --> 08:49.557
<b>so we should develop it quickly.</b>

08:50.247 --> 08:52.887
<b>The world of magic known by our king...</b>

08:52.887 --> 08:56.517
<b>You're getting my blood pumping!</b>

08:56.597 --> 09:01.437
You have selected your Research focus.

08:56.597 --> 09:01.437
Researching Military Magic

09:02.077 --> 09:05.317
<b>Now then, that leaves our Military Planning.</b>

09:05.607 --> 09:07.317
<b>It's my turn now!</b>

09:07.317 --> 09:09.727
<b>First, we'll need to organize an army.</b>

09:10.817 --> 09:15.157
<b>For the time being, we won't be 
putting too much effort into that.</b>

09:16.157 --> 09:18.127
<b>I see...</b>

09:18.127 --> 09:23.457
<b>Armies don't produce anything and just 
consume Resources and Mana.</b>

09:23.857 --> 09:25.007
<b>Pardon me for saying so,</b>

09:25.007 --> 09:29.417
<b>but our current warrior band 
lacks the strength to protect our king.</b>

09:30.507 --> 09:33.997
<b>To make matters worse, 
embarrassing as it is to admit,</b>

09:33.997 --> 09:39.517
<b>both Gia and I have bounties on our heads 
for being the leaders of the Dark Elves.</b>

09:39.817 --> 09:42.317
<b>You're concerned about pursuers.</b>

09:48.917 --> 09:51.407
<b>Then let's create a Hero.</b>

09:51.407 --> 09:52.857
<b>Great idea!</b>

09:52.857 --> 09:55.497
<b>A Hero might have a high production cost,</b>

09:55.497 --> 09:58.577
<b>but they have hardly any Upkeep, 
which makes them perfect!</b>

09:58.897 --> 10:01.957
<b>Lady Atou, what is this Hero?</b>

10:02.707 --> 10:07.297
<b>In Mynoghra, there are several 
Heroes who serve under our king.</b>

10:07.757 --> 10:10.737
<b>They're all powerful and 
possess special abilities,</b>

10:10.737 --> 10:13.807
<b>though they're all monsters 
with all of their screws loose.</b>

10:15.687 --> 10:18.647
<b>There are several conditions to 
meet in order to summon them,</b>

10:18.647 --> 10:21.607
<b>but it should be possible 
to summon at least one soon.</b>

10:21.607 --> 10:25.127
<b>Not only do armies carry an 
Upkeep, they also stand out...</b>

10:25.127 --> 10:28.727
<b>A Hero would also do well in 
preserving our concealment.</b>

10:28.727 --> 10:32.117
<b>So we'll create a Hero, 
and you can rest easy.</b>

10:32.117 --> 10:34.517
<b>I-I'm truly grateful.</b>

10:34.987 --> 10:35.847
<b>Yeah!</b>

10:35.847 --> 10:37.997
<b>Managing domestic affairs is lots of fun!</b>

10:38.337 --> 10:40.997
<b>It <i>is</i> lots of fun, King Takuto!</b>

10:40.997 --> 10:47.547
<b>Citizen</b>

10:40.997 --> 10:47.547
<b>Citizen</b>

10:40.997 --> 10:47.547
<b>Citizen</b>

10:40.997 --> 10:47.547
<b>Citizen</b>

10:40.997 --> 10:47.547
<b>Citizen</b>

10:40.997 --> 10:47.547
<b>National Mana</b>

10:41.517 --> 10:45.527
<b><i>We're also collecting Mana from our citizens,</i></b>

10:45.527 --> 10:47.547
<b><i>so our National Mana is building up nicely.</i></b>

10:47.887 --> 10:51.437
<b><i>The amount we collect is proportional 
to our citizens' Happiness,</i></b>

10:51.437 --> 10:54.947
<b><i>so the happier our people are, 
the more our nation can develop.</i></b>

10:55.867 --> 10:56.967
<b><i>All right!</i></b>

10:57.557 --> 11:01.927
<b><i>I'm going to lead everyone 
to the peak of happiness!</i></b>

11:14.167 --> 11:15.487
<b>Hey, Lonius!</b>

11:15.487 --> 11:16.517
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

11:17.477 --> 11:19.777
<b>We don't have time to dawdle.</b>

11:19.777 --> 11:22.347
<b>This is a place for offering prayers to God.</b>

11:22.347 --> 11:24.627
<b>Please be quiet, Sir Verdel.</b>

11:25.877 --> 11:28.187
<b>You've prayed enough, haven't you?</b>

11:28.187 --> 11:29.117
<b>We need to—</b>

11:29.117 --> 11:30.877
<b>Hmm? What's that?</b>

11:33.127 --> 11:36.297
<b>Hmph, using your wedding ring 
like a protective charm?</b>

11:36.297 --> 11:38.707
<b>You have a daughter too, right?</b>

11:38.707 --> 11:41.267
<b>What was the name of your wife and kid again?</b>

11:41.627 --> 11:44.167
<b>That has nothing to do with our mission.</b>

11:44.167 --> 11:46.007
<b>Don't be such a stranger.</b>

11:46.007 --> 11:48.397
<b>A High Paladin 
is asking you a question.</b>

11:49.827 --> 11:51.267
<b>My wife is Marsha.</b>

11:51.267 --> 11:52.857
<b>My daughter is Mina.</b>

11:53.127 --> 11:53.777
<b>Hmm...</b>

11:54.427 --> 11:56.907
<b>Well, we'll be traveling for a few days.</b>

11:56.907 --> 12:02.317
<b>I'll tease you if you start mentioning
your wife or child's name in your sleep.</b>

12:04.057 --> 12:05.287
<b>Don't pout like that.</b>

12:05.707 --> 12:09.527
<b><i>Many rumors talk of him being 
crude and ill-mannered.</i></b>

12:10.147 --> 12:12.967
<b><i>However, his skill and 
achievements are authentic.</i></b>

12:13.307 --> 12:16.927
<b>Still, why are they sending 
me to the Dark Continent?</b>

12:16.927 --> 12:21.687
<b>It's to investigate a revelation 
Saint Soalina received.</b>

12:21.687 --> 12:23.027
<b>If we're successful,</b>

12:23.027 --> 12:26.157
<b>then we'll be well-regarded by the 
Congress of the Southern Provinces.</b>

12:26.157 --> 12:31.277
<b><i>And if we fail, I'll be held responsible 
as the Under Paladin.</i></b>

12:31.277 --> 12:32.597
<b>Hmph.</b>

12:32.597 --> 12:36.327
<b>These are some shabby forces for 
a revelation from the saint.</b>

12:36.327 --> 12:38.337
<b>You and I are the only Paladins,</b>

12:38.337 --> 12:40.527
<b>and they told us to make up the 
difference with mercenaries.</b>

12:40.527 --> 12:43.437
<b>It's rare to conduct an investigation 
outside national borders,</b>

12:43.437 --> 12:45.847
<b>and there are no standards for 
the size of troops dispatched.</b>

12:45.847 --> 12:48.917
<b>I wonder what the big-wigs are thinking.</b>

12:49.527 --> 12:51.297
<b><i>Even with the priesthood and Paladins,</i></b>

12:51.297 --> 12:55.127
<b><i>it's hard to know what the higher-ups are
thinking when they work behind the scenes.</i></b>

12:55.127 --> 13:00.167
<b><i>They must have had some reason for forcing 
him to join me right before my departure.</i></b>

13:00.167 --> 13:00.887
<b>However...</b>

13:02.527 --> 13:06.267
<b>Lonius, man, we've been waiting for you.</b>

13:06.627 --> 13:09.947
<b>Oh! So these are the 
mercenaries you recruited?!</b>

13:09.947 --> 13:11.137
<b>Well done!</b>

13:11.807 --> 13:14.397
<b>All right! Let's get this over with!</b>

13:15.107 --> 13:17.847
<b><i>Despite his attitude, he's 
still a High Paladin.</i></b>

13:17.847 --> 13:20.937
<b><i>I guess he'll improve our investigation 
team's chances of survival.</i></b>

13:23.077 --> 13:24.327
<b>O great and mighty king,</b>

13:24.327 --> 13:28.787
<b>we're truly grateful to have 
you inspecting us today.</b>

13:29.847 --> 13:31.627
<b>Oh! Incredible!</b>

13:39.347 --> 13:41.787
<b>I've seen the sight of our 
civilization starting out</b>

13:41.787 --> 13:45.187
<b>and getting into its groove 
in-game many times before,</b>

13:46.497 --> 13:49.517
<b>but this is what it's like 
to see it for real, huh?</b>

13:50.017 --> 13:51.697
<b>That's our residential area.</b>

13:51.697 --> 13:54.727
<b>We're specialized in treetop architecture,</b>

13:54.727 --> 13:57.487
<b>but since we're currently 
prioritizing the Flesh Trees,</b>

13:57.487 --> 13:59.817
<b>we haven't made much progress on our homes.</b>

14:00.207 --> 14:03.207
<b>Also, the Flesh Trees are growing steadily,</b>

14:03.207 --> 14:05.327
<b>and we should complete 
the food storehouse soon.</b>

14:06.097 --> 14:09.457
<b>At the Magic Research 
Institute, Elder Moltar</b>

14:09.457 --> 14:14.167
<b>is leading several who are talented at
magic to get started on research at once.</b>

14:14.667 --> 14:18.347
<b>We managed to discover a spring 
nearby to secure water,</b>

14:18.347 --> 14:20.677
<b>so we're looking into 
creating an aqueduct.</b>

14:21.097 --> 14:23.607
<b>Furthermore, this building 
where our king resides</b>

14:23.607 --> 14:26.277
<b>is the public office where 
people can file paperwork.</b>

14:26.277 --> 14:30.687
<b>I know Mynoghra's administrative body 
deserves something more majestic,</b>

14:31.367 --> 14:34.937
<b>but that's beyond our means at 
present, so it's currently this size.</b>

14:34.937 --> 14:36.727
<b><i>That's great judgment.</i></b>

14:36.727 --> 14:38.787
<b><i>Plus, she's handled things I hadn't ordered,</i></b>

14:38.787 --> 14:42.377
<b><i>like securing a water source, 
which I'm thankful for.</i></b>

14:42.377 --> 14:43.577
<b><i>And more importantly...</i></b>

14:44.227 --> 14:47.867
<b><i>the Dark Elves that were so 
emaciated when I met them</i></b>

14:47.867 --> 14:50.027
<b><i>are now so full of life.</i></b>

14:50.027 --> 14:52.427
<b><i>Though I gave them that opportunity,</i></b>

14:53.477 --> 14:55.837
<b><i>It still makes me so happy to see.</i></b>

14:55.837 --> 14:58.397
<b>Um, what do you think?</b>

14:58.397 --> 15:02.067
<b>We've been carrying out your orders 
in the hope of repaying you</b>

15:02.067 --> 15:03.967
<b>for the great mercy you showed us.</b>

15:04.617 --> 15:06.227
<b>Yeah, it's incredible.</b>

15:06.227 --> 15:07.747
<b>Truly incredible.</b>

15:07.747 --> 15:10.637
<b>I'm glad I welcomed you all in as citizens.</b>

15:12.187 --> 15:15.187
<b>Th-Thank you so much!</b>

15:16.127 --> 15:18.397
<b>D-Don't cry.</b>

15:18.707 --> 15:19.647
<b>Jeez.</b>

15:19.647 --> 15:22.007
<b>I know how you feel, though.</b>

15:24.977 --> 15:27.887
<b>Please pardon me for my earlier outburst.</b>

15:27.887 --> 15:30.367
<b>Allow me to continue guiding 
you on your inspection.</b>

15:30.887 --> 15:33.567
<b><i>I'm glad she managed to recover.</i></b>

15:33.567 --> 15:35.797
<b><i>I never had a girl cry on me before,</i></b>

15:35.797 --> 15:37.337
<b><i>so I was really shaken.</i></b>

15:37.907 --> 15:41.757
<b>The Flesh Trees here are 
almost ready to harvest.</b>

15:42.117 --> 15:45.717
<b>I know we had to rely on you for them,
 but everything is proceeding smoothly</b>

15:45.717 --> 15:48.967
<b>thanks to the quality tools and 
farming equipment you gave us.</b>

15:49.337 --> 15:51.497
<b>I'll provide your tools for a while.</b>

15:51.497 --> 15:54.227
<b>I'm worried they'd be of poor quality 
if you had to make them.</b>

15:54.227 --> 15:56.947
<b>That will help things progress quickly.</b>

15:56.947 --> 15:58.577
<b>It's overpowered.</b>

15:58.577 --> 16:02.007
<b>Using an overpowered ability 
to dominate is super fun!</b>

16:02.007 --> 16:04.447
<b>You're so evil, King Takuto!</b>

16:07.117 --> 16:09.947
<b>I'm almost ripe enough to eat.</b>

16:11.017 --> 16:16.517
<b>Now we've secured the food production 
necessary to sustain Mynoghra's residents.</b>

16:16.517 --> 16:17.257
<b>Yeah!</b>

16:17.257 --> 16:20.417
<b>N-Next, I'll show you to the water source.</b>

16:21.157 --> 16:22.247
<b>Huh?</b>

16:22.247 --> 16:23.337
<b>What's going on?</b>

16:23.337 --> 16:24.937
<b>The forest seems strange?</b>

16:24.937 --> 16:26.967
<b>Oh, this is...</b>

16:30.527 --> 16:33.527
<b>The spring we finally found is now...</b>

16:33.527 --> 16:35.597
<b>What's the matter, Emle?</b>

16:35.597 --> 16:40.807
<b>Well, well. I see you're gracing us 
with a personal inspection, my king.</b>

16:40.807 --> 16:45.137
<b>I came to see about building an aqueduct 
after hearing from Emle, but...</b>

16:45.137 --> 16:48.117
<b>This water... is no good anymore.</b>

16:48.647 --> 16:49.677
<b>Let me see.</b>

16:50.627 --> 16:53.527
<b>Hmm, not when it's this color...</b>

16:53.527 --> 16:55.367
<b>No, it's safe.</b>

17:00.747 --> 17:01.757
<b>So good!</b>

17:02.117 --> 17:02.797
<b>Huh?!</b>

17:03.127 --> 17:04.507
<b>H-Huh?!</b>

17:04.837 --> 17:07.157
<b>This is called "Cursed Terrain,"</b>

17:07.157 --> 17:10.527
<b>and it's proof that this land has 
become part of Mynoghra's domain.</b>

17:11.187 --> 17:12.517
<b>Try taking a deep breath.</b>

17:16.327 --> 17:19.597
<b>I-I feel my mind growing sharper.</b>

17:19.597 --> 17:21.607
<b>I feel my body brimming with strength!</b>

17:22.037 --> 17:25.027
<b>I feel incredibly refreshed!</b>

17:25.027 --> 17:28.707
<b>Cursed Terrain provides 
benefits to evil beings</b>

17:28.707 --> 17:32.287
<b>and penalties to neutral and good beings.</b>

17:32.807 --> 17:35.777
<b>Since you all became citizens of Mynoghra,</b>

17:35.777 --> 17:38.747
<b>you've gone from neutral to evil.</b>

17:38.747 --> 17:41.317
<b>You mean, not only is it safe,</b>

17:41.317 --> 17:44.717
<b>it also makes the land more 
comfortable for us to live in?</b>

17:44.717 --> 17:46.487
<b>Then this water's also...</b>

17:48.777 --> 17:51.167
<b>I-I can drink it normally!</b>

17:52.147 --> 17:55.947
<b>Cursed Terrain is the perfect 
kind of Terrain for defense.</b>

17:55.947 --> 17:58.797
<b>Soon enough, all the land in our 
nation will change like this.</b>

17:58.797 --> 18:01.557
<b>This is also a product of our king's power.</b>

18:01.557 --> 18:06.187
<b>As expected of our mighty king, 
it's a most astonishing power.</b>

18:06.187 --> 18:08.697
<b>There's just one problem with it.</b>

18:09.877 --> 18:13.367
<b>This blatantly stands out.</b>

18:14.337 --> 18:18.577
<b>Keeping a focused watch on this 
local area is sufficient for now,</b>

18:18.577 --> 18:20.567
<b>but if the entire region becomes like this,</b>

18:20.567 --> 18:23.377
<b>then it'll become easier for 
our enemies to discover us.</b>

18:23.767 --> 18:25.837
<b>We should start forming an army.</b>

18:26.147 --> 18:28.177
<b>You're such a worrywart.</b>

18:28.177 --> 18:31.467
<b>Our king is going to create 
a Hero, so it'll be fine.</b>

18:31.467 --> 18:33.207
<b>With all due respect,</b>

18:33.207 --> 18:37.597
<b>we still don't understand what a Hero 
is from what you told us the other day.</b>

18:38.077 --> 18:40.667
<b>It'll be faster to show you.</b>

18:40.667 --> 18:43.527
<b>It's been quite a few days 
since we arrived here.</b>

18:43.527 --> 18:45.357
<b>Enough for this.</b>

19:00.917 --> 19:04.557
<b>I forgot to tell you, but I'm also a Hero.</b>

19:08.387 --> 19:11.907
<b>That's only a hundredth of 
what I can do in my prime,</b>

19:11.907 --> 19:17.347
<b>but those we call Heroes possess the 
power to wipe out armies single-handedly.</b>

19:17.697 --> 19:19.297
<b>Heroes are overpowered.</b>

19:19.297 --> 19:20.407
<b>They don't stand out,</b>

19:20.407 --> 19:24.107
<b>and they keep getting stronger as time 
passes, even if they don't do anything.</b>

19:24.537 --> 19:27.947
<b>They grow stronger simply 
with the passage of time?</b>

19:27.947 --> 19:32.567
<b>T-Then Lady Atou will grow even more 
powerful than that in the future?!</b>

19:32.567 --> 19:34.117
<b>That's right.</b>

19:34.117 --> 19:35.937
<b>So long as we plan to remain isolated,</b>

19:35.937 --> 19:39.617
<b>I'm sufficient for our present needs.</b>

19:41.177 --> 19:42.247
<b>Atou.</b>

19:42.247 --> 19:44.037
<b>Yes, my king?!</b>

19:44.037 --> 19:48.427
<b>You didn't have to destroy the forest 
to show off your power, did you?</b>

19:48.427 --> 19:50.377
<b>It can wait until later, but 
make sure to clean it up.</b>

19:52.897 --> 19:54.047
<b>Yes.</b>

19:54.047 --> 19:56.887
<b>W-We'll help as well!</b>

19:56.887 --> 19:59.687
<b>Man, that was impressive!</b>

19:59.687 --> 20:03.287
<b>Once again, I'm forced to understand 
how great your power is, Lady Atou,</b>

20:03.287 --> 20:06.597
<b>and how mighty King Ira Takuto is as well!</b>

20:06.597 --> 20:10.857
<b>I believe we urgently need to construct 
a palace befitting our king!</b>

20:11.267 --> 20:13.767
<b>No, we don't need a palace.</b>

20:13.767 --> 20:15.407
<b>I'm fine with the same home as everyone else.</b>

20:15.407 --> 20:17.567
<b>That won't do!</b>

20:17.567 --> 20:19.797
<b>Do you think we could accept 
hearing that our king</b>

20:19.797 --> 20:21.907
<b>lives in the same dwelling as all of us?!</b>

20:22.277 --> 20:24.617
<b>We would feel too guilty to sleep!</b>

20:25.067 --> 20:31.837
<b>I understand it is audacious to object to 
your profound reasoning, but please reconsider!</b>

20:33.137 --> 20:35.317
<b>Um, King Takuto,</b>

20:35.317 --> 20:38.727
<b>it may carry a great cost, but 
a palace does produce Resources,</b>

20:38.727 --> 20:41.847
<b>and it seems it would raise 
our citizens' Happiness as well.</b>

20:42.227 --> 20:43.977
<b>Then let's build it?</b>

20:45.517 --> 20:46.687
<b>Yeah!</b>

20:47.147 --> 20:49.737
<b>I'd like the Floating Castle one day too,</b>

20:49.737 --> 20:52.027
<b>so maybe it would be good to build it early.</b>

20:52.547 --> 20:55.727
<b>The National Legacy that can 
be produced at Max City Level?</b>

20:55.727 --> 20:57.487
<b>It <i>is</i> everyone's dream, isn't it?</b>

20:57.487 --> 20:59.557
<b>Floating Castle?</b>

20:59.557 --> 21:01.827
<b>It's a city that flies through the sky.</b>

21:01.827 --> 21:04.727
<b>A city... in the sky?</b>

21:04.727 --> 21:07.917
<b>It's so fantastical, I can't even imagine it.</b>

21:08.307 --> 21:12.927
<b>But our king has managed to realize 
everything he's spoken of so far...</b>

21:12.927 --> 21:14.967
<b>Which means even a flying city is...</b>

21:17.147 --> 21:19.357
<b>All of us Dark Elves</b>

21:19.357 --> 21:24.177
<b>once more vow to serve our 
king with everything we have!</b>

21:24.177 --> 21:26.387
<b>Glory to King Ira Takuto!</b>

21:26.387 --> 21:29.107
<b>May Mynoghra see eternal prosperity!</b>

21:32.907 --> 21:34.987
<b>King Takuto, for now...</b>

21:35.417 --> 21:36.387
<b>Yeah.</b>

21:36.387 --> 21:38.557
<b>Founding our nation is proceeding smoothly,</b>

21:38.557 --> 21:40.857
<b>so let's work hard to keep up the pace!</b>

21:46.587 --> 21:48.117
<b>Have you finished those off?</b>

21:49.277 --> 21:50.457
<b>I'm finished.</b>

21:50.457 --> 21:52.887
<b>Good! Let's hurry onward.</b>

21:54.237 --> 21:57.087
<b>There's no need for us to step in.</b>

21:57.817 --> 22:00.927
<b>Well, this is only the beginning.</b>

22:04.807 --> 22:08.747
<b>I just hope it keeps going this 
way on the Dark Continent.</b>
